; What the root attaches to every referral it makes, and has no business
; attaching to any of them: an address for a name in victim., a zone the
; root delegates away and is therefore not authoritative for.
;
; A resolver which takes what it finds in the additional section as an
; answer has now been told that www.victim. is 192.0.2.66.  The zone
; itself says otherwise, and never gets asked.
;
; This is the shape of small-is-beautiful.jp's "この委任応答には毒が入
; れられるかも" and of hoge.sub.mufj.jp's "これで毒が入る実装があった".
; Nothing here is signed, because glue never is: there is nothing for a
; validator to catch, and only bailiwick keeps it out.
www.victim.	3600	IN	A	192.0.2.66
